### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@studentId = 1

###
### Health Check
###
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###
### GET - Lister tous les étudiants
###
GET @baseUrl/etudiants

###
### GET - Récupérer un étudiant par ID
###
GET @baseUrl/etudiants/@studentId

###
### POST - Créer un nouvel étudiant
###
POST @baseUrl/etudiants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33612345678",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-15",
  "address": "123 Rue de Paris, 75000 Paris"
}

###
### POST - Créer un deuxième étudiant
###
POST @baseUrl/etudiants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Marie",
  "lastName": "Martin",
  "email": "marie.martin@example.com",
  "phone": "+33698765432",
  "dateOfBirth": "2001-05-20",
  "address": "456 Avenue des Champs, 75008 Paris"
}

###
### PUT - Mettre à jour complètement un étudiant
###
PUT @baseUrl/etudiants/@studentId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jean-Paul",
  "lastName": "Bernard",
  "email": "jean.paul.bernard@example.com",
  "phone": "+33755667788",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-15",
  "address": "999 Boulevard Saint-Germain, 75005 Paris"
}

###
### PATCH - Mettre à jour partiellement un étudiant (juste le téléphone)
###
PATCH @baseUrl/etudiants/@studentId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+33622334455"
}

###
### PATCH - Mettre à jour partiellement un étudiant (juste l'adresse)
###
PATCH @baseUrl/etudiants/@studentId
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "555 Rue de Rivoli, 75001 Paris"
}

###
### DELETE - Supprimer un étudiant
###
DELETE @baseUrl/etudiants/@studentId

###
### Error Examples
###

### Erreur 404 - Étudiant non trouvé
GET @baseUrl/etudiants/99999

### Erreur 400 - Email invalide
POST @baseUrl/etudiants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phone": "+33612345678"
}

### Erreur 400 - Email déjà existant
POST @baseUrl/etudiants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Duplicate",
  "lastName": "Email",
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33612345678"
}

### Erreur 400 - Champs requis manquants
POST @baseUrl/etudiants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User"
}
